{"metadata":{"name":"Jami At Tirmidhi","section":{"2":"The Book on Salat (Prayer)"},"section_detail":{"2":{"hadithnumber_first":149,"hadithnumber_last":451,"arabicnumber_first":149,"arabicnumber_last":451,"name_native":"كتاب الصلاة"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":342,"arabicnumber":342,"text":"حدثنا محمد بن ابي معشر، حدثنا ابي، عن محمد بن عمرو، عن ابي سلمة، عن ابي هريرة، قال قال رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم \" ما بين المشرق والمغرب قبلة","grades":[{"name":"Ahmad Muhammad Shakir","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Sahih"}],"reference":{"book":2,"hadith":194}}]}